# Windows batch files are stored exactly as written, CRLF and all. With `text eol=crlf` git
# would store them with LF and convert only on checkout -- so the copy GitHub serves as a raw
# download, which the README links to, would reach Windows with the wrong line endings.
*.bat  -text
*.cmd  -text

# Firmware and images are binary.
*.bin  binary
*.png  binary
